    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22-a1">

                <pb facs="0375" n="365" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg365"/>

                <head>Appendix 193<anchor n="1" xml:id="d22-f1"/></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Decision of the Council of the
                        Principal Allied and Associated Powers at a Meeting Held on the 13th June,
                        1919</hi> [<hi rendition="#italic">Regarding</hi>] <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reimposition of the Blockade</hi><anchor n="2" xml:id="d22-f2"/></p>
                <p>The Council of the Principal Allied and Associated Powers have considered the
                    note of the Superior Blockade Council, dated the 11th June, 1919 (attached).</p>
                <p>They have decided that the Blockade Council should make every preparation for the
                    reimposition of the blockade, but that its actual <pb facs="0376" n="366"
                        xml:id="pg366"/> enforcement should not be undertaken, even in the event of
                    the refusal by the Germans to sign the Treaty of Peace, without a decision from
                    the Council of the Principal Allied and Associated Powers. No actual threat
                    should be made public that the blockade is to be reimposed, but, short of this,
                    steps should be taken to give the public impression that preparations are in
                    hand. If practicable, these steps should include the despatch of destroyers to
                    show themselves in the Baltic.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>W. W.</item>
                            <item>G. C.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. Ll. G.</hi></item>
                            <item>S. S.</item>
                            <item>N. M.</item>
                        </list></signed>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-06-13"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >June</hi> 13, 1919</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
